  "content": [
    {
      "text": "second son of Alma2, goes on mission to Zoramites2, Alma 31:7 (38:1). Alma2 gives commandments to Shiblon, Alma 38. is successful in ministry, Alma 49:30. takes charge of sacred things, Alma 63:1. confers sacred things on Helaman3, dies, Alma 63:10–11.",
